  "details": "My idea is, that it would be helpful to get a small indicator if someone is on Desktop, VR Mode or Android Mode.\n\nAnd I don't mean the indicator above the name.\n\nMy idea is more like an indicator for >online friends< on the website and maybe for online friends in the ingame menu too.\n\nYou can maybe compare it a bit with discord itself. If someone is online with the phone, then the green dot changes to an mobile phone.\n\nBut this is just an example.\n\nI think that this could be useful if the Mobile Version releases someday in the future.\n\nSo you can see right away if someone is online with Desktop, PC VR (or VR in general including Quest!) and Android Mode (Quest and Mobile Version together OR just the Mobile Version itself!)\n\nI hope you get the idea.",
